(guard (e (#t #f))
  (jolt-invoke (var-deref "clojure.core" "attach-core-doc-meta!") "clojure.core" "set-error-mode!" "Sets the error-mode of agent a to mode-keyword, which must be\n  either :fail or :continue.  If an action being run by the agent\n  throws an exception or doesn't pass the validator fn, an\n  error-handler may be called (see set-error-handler!), after which,\n  if the mode is :continue, the agent will continue as if neither the\n  action that caused the error nor the error itself ever happened.\n  \n  If the mode is :fail, the agent will become failed and will stop\n  accepting new 'send' and 'send-off' actions, and any previously\n  queued actions will be held until a 'restart-agent'.  Deref will\n  still work, returning the state of the agent before the error." (jolt-list-pos 338 4 (jolt-vector (jolt-symbol #f "a") (jolt-symbol #f "mode-keyword"))) jolt-nil))
